# Local archive/staging dir (contains a 210MB Archive.zip) - never commit
quanntflow/

# No archives, with no exceptions.
#
# Three of these used to be un-ignored by name, and two of those carried a
# live `.env` holding vendor API keys, tracked in a public repo. An archive is opaque
# to every review that reads a diff, so the exception list is what made the
# leak possible; there is no exception list now. The unpacked, current sources
# are `quantflow-modules/` and this repo itself.
#
# `backend/test/committedSecrets.test.ts` enforces this against tracked files
# rather than trusting the pattern.
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Preview captures — snapshots of a live backend, not source
.preview/
